Package: Rsafd
Type: Package
Title: Statistical Analysis of Financial Data in R
Version: 1.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Rene", "Carmona", email = "rcarmona@princeton.edu",
           role = c("aut", "cre")))
Description: Functions and data sets accompanying the book 'Statistical
    Analysis of Financial Data in R' by Rene Carmona (2014,
    <doi:10.1007/978-1-4614-8788-3>). Includes tools for heavy-tailed
    distributions and extreme value analysis, copulas, nonparametric
    smoothing, time series models, and fixed-income and option pricing
    utilities.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/PrincetonUniversity/Rsafd
BugReports: https://github.com/PrincetonUniversity/Rsafd/issues
Depends:
    R (>= 4.2.0)
Imports:
    graphics,
    MASS,
    methods,
    plot3D,
    quantreg,
    robustbase,
    stats,
    timeDate,
    tseries,
    utils
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
LazyDataCompression: xz
NeedsCompilation: no
Collate:
    Financial.R
    Univariate.R
    Multivariate.R
    Smoothing.R
    timeSeries.R
    native-ports.R
